// probe: the prelude's `__inline_event` declaration is an ordinary typed
// call, and its body is the compiler's own — the source body answers
// `false` for every site, so a `true` at site 7 and a `false` at site 8
// is the synthesised `match site` running.
println("at7=${__inline_event(7, 0, 0, "")}")
println("at8=${__inline_event(8, 0, 0, "")}")
